    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing Her Light is an emotional survival-adventure game about loss, memory, and the bond between man and dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing his wife in a tragic car accident, a man escapes the chaos of the city and retreats to a remote forest cabin \u2014 his only companion being the dog she gifted him shortly before her death. But one day, the dog vanishes into the wilderness. Now, armed only with an axe and fading warmth, he journeys deep into the snow-covered forest to find her\u2026 and perhaps, a piece of himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Progressive Tree-Cutting System \u2013 Trees don\u2019t fall in one hit. Chop through multiple stages with visual feedback at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Search for Your Dog \u2013 Each tree you cut brings you closer to your lost companion, and deeper into the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Heat Management \u2013 The forest is cold and unforgiving. Stay warm by building fires and managing your heat bar wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 Upgradeable Axes \u2013 Improve your axe to cut faster and reach areas previously blocked by denser trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Resource Gathering &amp; Economy \u2013 Collect and sell wood or rare pinecones to afford upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Survival in Isolation \u2013 Your cabin is your only refuge. Keep your fire alive or freeze to death in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing Her Light is a quiet, deeply personal journey \u2014 a story of healing in the heart of a frozen wilderness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing Her Light is an emotional survival-adventure game about loss, memory, and the bond between man and dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing his wife in a tragic car accident, a man escapes the chaos of the city and retreats to a remote forest cabin \u2014 his only companion being the dog she gifted him shortly before her death. But one day, the dog vanishes into the wilderness. Now, armed only with an axe and fading warmth, he journeys deep into the snow-covered forest to find her\u2026 and perhaps, a piece of himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Progressive Tree-Cutting System \u2013 Trees don\u2019t fall in one hit. Chop through multiple stages with visual feedback at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Search for Your Dog \u2013 Each tree you cut brings you closer to your lost companion, and deeper into the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Heat Management \u2013 The forest is cold and unforgiving. Stay warm by building fires and managing your heat bar wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 Upgradeable Axes \u2013 Improve your axe to cut faster and reach areas previously blocked by denser trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf92 Resource Gathering &amp; Economy \u2013 Collect and sell wood or rare pinecones to afford upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Survival in Isolation \u2013 Your cabin is your only refuge. Keep your fire alive or freeze to death in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing Her Light is a quiet, deeply personal journey \u2014 a story of healing in the heart of a frozen wilderness.</p>",
